WEBVTT

00:06:59.516 --> 00:07:02.716
She suggested that I take
a break from social media,

00:07:02.756 --> 00:07:06.236
to ground myself instead
of quitting for good,

00:07:06.236 --> 00:07:09.036
and that was actually great advice.

00:07:09.076 --> 00:07:11.836
It helped me gain
some important perspective.

00:07:12.916 --> 00:07:16.036
To be sure, there are
bigger dynamics at play

00:07:16.076 --> 00:07:19.356
that require the leadership
of social media platforms

00:07:19.356 --> 00:07:20.636
and the government

00:07:20.676 --> 00:07:23.556
to make sure we're
as safe as possible online,

00:07:23.596 --> 00:07:25.636
especially in the case of kids.

00:07:25.676 --> 00:07:27.516
These are complex issues,

00:07:27.556 --> 00:07:31.316
and while we can work as individuals
to be more resilient